{
  "id": "ss.terrain.web-span",
  "name": "Silk span (SS)",
  "description": "A curtain of silk strung between two trunks, authored along +x and stretched to whatever gap the game found one in. Six threads in three segments each so they droop, the middle pair hanging lowest, with cross threads between them \u2014 one catenary is a line, six at different depths is a curtain, and the crosses are what stop it reading as a fence. It thickens at both ends where it is tied on, which is the part that says anchored rather than floating. `torn` is what is left after a body has been through the middle of it.",
